    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58162" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνησ-μώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>affected with itching</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				6.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				1.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.261
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>accompanied with itching</i> or <i>irritation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				887a35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				7.197
			</span></i>. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					19.70
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>causing irritation</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					11.13.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
